{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54534","headline":"兵要望江南 占云第三（京本作「占云第二十四○二十六首」） 二十一 · 易静","name":"兵要望江南 占云第三（京本作「占云第二十四○二十六首」） 二十一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"[观]（现）（从辛本、京本改）云气，择士细详（京本作「汝当」）看。\n昼夜[用]（同）（从辛本改）心精审究（京本作「却须精细审」），莫将此事以（京本作「拟」）爲闲，风色便（辛本作「辨」，京本作「旺」）相干。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"易静","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54534.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54534","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}